{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000135506","approvedSymbol":"OS9","functionDescriptions":["Lectin component of the HRD1 complex, which functions in endoplasmic reticulum (ER) quality control and ER-associated degradation (ERAD) (PubMed:18264092, PubMed:18417469, PubMed:19084021, PubMed:19346256, PubMed:21172656, PubMed:24899641). Specifically recognizes and binds improperly folded glycoproteins as well as hyperglycosylated proteins, retain them in the ER, and transfers them to the ubiquitination machinery and promote their degradation (PubMed:18264092, PubMed:18417469, PubMed:19084021, PubMed:19346256, PubMed:21172656, PubMed:24899641). Possible targets include TRPV4 as well as hyperglycosylated HSP90B1 (PubMed:17932042). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:17932042, ECO:0000269|PubMed:18264092, ECO:0000269|PubMed:18417469, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19084021, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19346256, ECO:0000269|PubMed:21172656, ECO:0000269|PubMed:24899641}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q13438","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A8V8TPZ4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TPZ9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TQ04","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TQI0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TQI2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TQI4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TQI8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TQI9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TR31","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TR34","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TR37","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TRD7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8V8TRE0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"B4E321","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F8VWQ2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F8VZI7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F8W0R2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F8W1N0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F8W1V2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000257966","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000318165","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000373794","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"EN